+### Import tickets: `POST /tickets/import`
+
+For a move from another tracker. The body is a list of tickets, each as for `POST /tickets`, at most 5000 of them:
+
+```json
+{ "tickets": [
+  { "title": "VPN drops every hour", "requester": "maria@example.com", "priority": "high" },
+  { "title": "Printer jams", "requester": "li@example.com" }
