+
+Creates them in the given order, all of them, or none when any item is invalid: 400 `invalid`, and the message names the
+first invalid item by its index in the array (0 for the first). Answers 201 with how many were created and their ids:
+
+```json
+{ "created": 2, "ids": ["T-0001", "T-0002"] }
+```
